# 5-security-office.trk -- the found tape: the mall's jingle, played twice off
# the VHS in the security office. 16 rows per bar at the fixed 60 BPM clock;
# eleven silent bars first so it starts at bar 11 (44 s). Written in G.

track lead note vel         # 1  the trumpet on the tape

pattern wait 16 lead        # one empty bar

pattern jingle 2x16 lead
1:00 | D5:4  .8
1:04 | B4:2  .7
1:06 | G4:2  .65
1:08 | A4:6  .75
1:14 | B4:2  .6
2:00 | D5:6  .85
2:06 | E5:2  .7
2:08 | D5:8  .75

order wait*11
order jingle jingle
